step Bloodfeather harpies
  tip The Bloodfeather harpies nest on the slopes west and north of the glade. Mist, an injured sabercat, lies by the glade's west wall among them: lead her back to Sentinel Arynia at the moonwell before her time runs out.
  tip Careful: The harpies stand packed together, so extra ones often join a fight. Casters are mixed in among them.
  collect 5204 quest 937.1                    -- Bloodfeather Belt
  accept 938                                  -- Mist, by the west wall
  complete 938 @38.3,34.4                     -- Lead Mist to the moonwell

