  tip Take the portal down to Rut'theran Village. Nessa stands on the dock, Vesprystus by the hippogryphs. Once you have Flight to Auberdine, talk to Vesprystus again and choose the flight to Auberdine: it is free and lands beside Laird. If the flight map opens instead, close it and talk to him again holding Shift.
  turnin 6344                                 -- Nessa Shadowsong
  accept 6341
  getfp "Rut'theran Village" npc 3838         -- Vesprystus
  turnin 6341
  accept 6342

step Fly to Rut'theran Village
  zone Darkshore
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Dolanaar again
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Byancie takes a Refreshing Spring Water with the fronds and the vial: if you drank yours, buy another from Innkeeper Keldamyr in this inn before you hand in.
  turnin 99050                                -- Byancie, inside

step Taming the Beast
  only Hunter
  tip Each of Dazalar's quests hands you a Taming Rod: use it on the beast he names, then bring the rod back to him in Dolanaar. Webwood Lurkers creep around the village, Nightsaber Stalkers and Strigid Screechers roam the woods south of it.
  kill 1998 quest 6063.1 "Tame Webwood Lurker" -- Webwood Lurker: tame it with the Taming Rod
  turnin 6063                                 -- Dazalar
  accept 6101
  kill 2043 quest 6101.1 "Tame Nightsaber Stalker" -- Nightsaber Stalker: tame it with the Taming Rod
  turnin 6101
  accept 6102
  kill 1996 quest 6102.1 "Tame Strigid Screecher" -- Strigid Screecher: tame it with the Taming Rod
  turnin 6102                                 -- Tame Beast
  accept 6103                                 -- Jocaste in Darnassus takes it
  turnin 6103 only Hunter -- Jocaste, in the Cenarion Enclave: Beast Training

step Fly to Auberdine
  zone Teldrassil
  goto 58.4,93.9 "Rut'theran Village flight master"
  fly "Auberdine"

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  tip The boat docks west of the village. The flight master stands on the hill south of the inn; the quest givers are spread along the main street. Wizbang Cranktoggle stands upstairs in the inn: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart.
  turnin 6342                                 -- Laird
  accept 6343                                 -- Return to Nessa
  accept 3524                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  accept 983                                  -- Wizbang Cranktoggle, upstairs in the inn: take the stairs inside, the arrow cannot tell the floors apart
  getfp "Auberdine"
  accept 98025                                -- The WANTED poster outside the inn
  accept 4811                                 -- Sentinel Glynda Nal'Shea
  accept 954                                  -- Thundris Windweaver, north end of the village
# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Auberdine

step Fly to Rut'theran Village
  only !Druid
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Rut'theran Village"

step Return to Nessa
  only !Druid
  zone Teldrassil
  tip Fly back to Rut'theran Village from Caylais Moonfeather, hand Laird's Response to Nessa on the dock, then fly back to Auberdine.
  turnin 6343                                 -- Nessa Shadowsong
  fly "Auberdine"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- The beach

step The Long Wash
  zone Darkshore
  tip Tide Crawlers scuttle along the shore below the village; Buzzbox 827 stands on the beach just south of the docks. Darkshore Threshers swim in the shallows. The Beached Sea Creature lies on the shore just south of the village.
  collect 12242 quest 3524 @36.4,50.9 map 1439 -- Sea Creature Bones

step Auberdine
  zone Darkshore
  turnin 3524                                 -- Gwennyth Bly'Leggonde
  accept 4681
  accept 958
  accept 984                                  -- Terenthis
  accept 2118                                 -- Tharnariun Treetender